## Why This Is Asked
This question tests practical DP budget enforcement in a real API, including idempotency and budget rollover.

## Key Concepts
- Privacy budget accounting
- Idempotent API design
- Month rollover handling
- Auditability and logs

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode: debit epsilon atomically per compute
function debit(userId, month, eps) {
  const b = budgets[`${userId}:${month}`];
  if ((b.remaining -= eps) < 0) throw 'Budget exhausted';
  return b.remaining;
}
```

